{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.asahi.ambush",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她从背后冒出来",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.asahi.ambush",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.asahi.ambush",
    "idolId": "asahi",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "呼……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（天气真好啊——）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哇！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "啊哈哈！",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊，是あさひ啊……！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "吓到了吧～制作人先生。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那是，突然从背后大声喊，当然会吓到。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "刚才制作人先生的表情，超好笑的！",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "喂，别拿人取笑。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "啊哈哈。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "话说你来得真早啊。今天的课是下午吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "我提早出来了！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "在事务所也没事做，慢慢来也可以啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "在家里待着，也不会有有趣的事发生的！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真像あさひ会说的话。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "……是吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。那，离上课还有时间。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "那，制作人先生，陪我找有趣的事吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（这个人，真是一刻也停不下来啊……）",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "走吧走吧！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
